      "body": "Fixes #6554.\n\n**Defect (verified at current main):** `infra/talos/01b.us/save-secrets.sh` redirected `sops --encrypt` straight into `secrets.enc`, so the shell truncated the sole encrypted copy before sops ran; with no `set -e`, a failed encryption left `secrets.enc` at 0 bytes while the script exited 0 (reproduced with a stub sops exiting 1: exit 0, 25 bytes -> 0 bytes, md5-identical script).\n\n**Fix:**\n- `set -Eeuo pipefail` (house style) so tar/sops failures exit non-zero and `init-talos.sh` stops.\n- Encrypt to same-directory `mktemp` files; `mv` over `secrets.enc` only after sops exits 0 **and** the temp ciphertext is non-empty.\n- `EXIT` trap removes plaintext/ciphertext temps (plus stale legacy `secrets.tmp`) without touching the live `secrets.enc`.\n\n**Probes (stub sops, /tmp):**\n- failing sops: exit 1, `secrets.enc` sha256-identical, no leftover temps, stale `secrets.tmp` cleaned.\n- succeeding stub: exit 0, new ciphertext in place, no leftover temps.\n- sops exits 0 but writes nothing: exit 1, `secrets.enc` unchanged.\n- `load-secrets.sh` round-trip of a saved artifact extracts byte-identical `secrets/`.\n- `shellcheck --severity=warning` clean; `shfmt -d` clean.\n\nOut of scope: #6536 (dns/save.sh counterpart), `load-secrets.sh` hardening.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796801027&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8000&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8000&signature=71ebad15e809ebda76809ee17207299140c93ff3c72985338759184a0bf55f4a\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8000?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
